Octofriend is the 3rd Rare Kindness spell, released in '''Beta 27.0'''. It originally gave +2 HP to the targeted monster. '''Beta 40.0''' changed that to giving it +1/+1. The targeted monster would then have both [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Onion_San Tentacles] summoned adjacent to it. It costed 4G. '''Beta 52.1''' changed that by making the Tentacles be added to the user's hand instead for 2G. The Tentacles will have their cost reduced by/to 1G, to make the total cost the same.
[[File:Octofriend (Beta 40.0).png|thumb|194x194px|Beta 40.0]]

