[[File:Octofriend (Beta 42.0).png|thumb|189x189px|Beta 42.0]]
SOUL Type: Kindness

Cost:
* 4 (Post Beta 27.0)
* 2 (Post Beta 52.1, Current)

Effects:
* Give an ally monster +2 HP. Summon both Tentacles adjacent to it. (Post Beta 27.0)
* Give an ally monster +1/+1. Summon both Tentacles adjacent to it. (Post Beta 40.0)
* Give an ally monster +1/+1. Add both Tentacles to your hand with -1 cost. (Post Beta 52.1, Current)

Rarity: Blue (Rare)

